{"content":[{"c":["PADDAN, PADDAN-ARAM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Northwestern Mesopotamian district whose name means “Field of Aram,” distinguishing this flatland from the mountainous regions to the north and east. Paddan-aram is alternately called Paddan in ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.48.7","r":"Gen.48.7","rawR":"Gen.48.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.48.7","value":"Gen.48.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Genesis 48:7"},", the “land of Aram” in ",{"href":"?bref=Hos.12.12","r":"Hos.12.12","rawR":"Hos.12.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.12.12","value":"Hos.12.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hosea 12:12"},", and Aram-naharaim in ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.24.10","r":"Gen.24.10","rawR":"Gen.24.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.24.10","value":"Gen.24.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Genesis 24:10"}," meaning “Aram of the two rivers” (see ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg). The two rivers probably referred to the Euphrates and Balih rivers, between which this tract of land was situated."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=AramNaharaim_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"AramNaharaim_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"AramNaharaim_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Aram-naharaim"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"PaddanPaddanAram","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Genesis 48:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.48.7","rawQueryValue":"Gen.48.7","sourceRefExact":"Gen.48.7"},{"anchorText":"Hosea 12:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.12.12","rawQueryValue":"Hos.12.12","sourceRefExact":"Hos.12.12"},{"anchorText":"Genesis 24:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.24.10","rawQueryValue":"Gen.24.10","sourceRefExact":"Gen.24.10"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"34412ac8edd051c7c14db5657760e3e2d454bb5f3f72d0022a181088ebf7b492","sourceItemName":"PaddanPaddanAram","sourceItemOrder":3,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"PaddanPaddanAram","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Paddan, Paddan-Aram","title":"Paddan, Paddan-Aram","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}